7,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! I want to find the wolf! I'll just follow whoever seems the smartest and most confident. Who's the leader here?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,I believe stability is key. I will focus on factual consistency and weigh the reliability of each speaker before forming a conclusion. Let's keep the discussion orderly.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
