10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, intuition can be misleading. We should prioritize behavioral changes. If someone's logic shifts suddenly, it's a strong indicator of deception.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Asuka, you're so serious! But you're right about the shifts. I'll be looking for those little slips of the tongue that reveal a hidden side.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,Behavioral changes! That sounds like a detective movie! I'm going to watch everyone's faces really closely. I bet I can spot a liar!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. Observing how a person's narrative evolves over the days is the most reliable way to identify the Possessed or the Werewolf.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Precisely. The Werewolf must lie to survive, and the Possessed must lie to protect. Logic dictates that their stories will eventually diverge from the truth.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Let's establish a baseline now. If anyone makes a claim about their role today, we can compare it to their behavior tomorrow.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"A baseline? How clinical! But if it helps us find the wolf, I'm in. Just don't be too hard on me if I'm just being playful.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion seems really smart! I think I'll listen to Shion. If Shion says someone is a wolf, I'm totally voting for them!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
