45,1,3,talk,Rin,,See! May is just trying to act cute to hide the wolf! I'm with Asuka and Shion. May is acting super suspicious right now!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
